<quiz>
<question type="stack">
  <name><text>Rate of appreciation</text></name>
  <questiontext format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) A plot in {@t1@} was valued at Ksh \({@ksh(V0)@}\) and one year later at Ksh \({@ksh(V1)@}\). Find the rate of appreciation, as a percentage.</p><p>[[input:ans1]] % [[validation:ans1]] [[feedback:prt1]]</p><p>(b) A house in {@t2@} rose in value from Ksh \({@ksh(W0)@}\) to Ksh \({@ksh(W2)@}\) in \(2\) years, appreciating at the same rate each year. Find the yearly rate of appreciation.</p><p>[[input:ans2]] % [[validation:ans2]] [[feedback:prt2]]</p><p>Give each answer exactly or correct to 1 decimal place.</p>]]></text>
  </questiontext>
  <generalfeedback format="html">
    <text><![CDATA[<p>(a) The increase is \({@ksh(V1)@} - {@ksh(V0)@} = {@ksh(V1-V0)@}\). As a percentage of the starting value:</p><p>\[\frac{{@ksh(V1-V0)@}}{{@ksh(V0)@}} \times 100 = {@dd(ra)@}\%.\]</p><p>(b) Over two years the value is multiplied by \(\left(1 + \frac{r}{100}\right)^2\), so</p><p>\[\left(1 + \frac{r}{100}\right)^2 = \frac{{@ksh(W2)@}}{{@ksh(W0)@}} = {@dd(ratio)@}, \qquad 1 + \frac{r}{100} = \sqrt{ {@dd(ratio)@} } = {@dd(1+r2/100)@}.\]</p><p>The yearly rate is \({@r2@}\%\). Halving the total rise of \({@dd(tot)@}\%\) gives \({@dd(hf)@}\%\), which is too big: each year's rise is on a bigger value.</p>]]></text>
  </generalfeedback>
  <defaultgrade>2</defaultgrade>
  <penalty>0.1</penalty>
  <hidden>0</hidden>
  <idnumber></idnumber>
  <stackversion><text>2026063000</text></stackversion>
  <questionvariables>
    <text><![CDATA[kgrp(n) := block([s, out, k], s: string(n), k: slength(s), if k < 5 then s else (out: "", while k > 3 do (out: sconcat("\\,", substring(s, k-2, k+1), out), k: k-3), sconcat(substring(s, 1, k+1), out)));
ksh(v) := block([c, w, f], c: floor(100*v+1/2), w: floor(c/100), f: c-100*w, if f = 0 then kgrp(w) else sconcat(kgrp(w), ".", if f < 10 then "0" else "", string(f)));
dd(v) := if integerp(v) then v else if integerp(10*v) then dispdp(float(v),1) else if integerp(100*v) then dispdp(float(v),2) else if integerp(1000*v) then dispdp(float(v),3) else dispdp(float(v),4);
ix: 1+rand(10);
/* Design: [V0, V1, W0, r2]; W2 = W0 (1 + r2/100)^2 is whole on every entry. Source: original. */
L: [[460000,506000,1200000,10],[760000,820800,880000,16],[1600000,1840000,500000,20],[380000,418000,2400000,5],[2500000,2725000,640000,25],[960000,1036800,1500000,12],[540000,588600,3000000,8],[1250000,1400000,760000,30],[680000,731000,2000000,6],[3400000,3672000,900000,18]];
E: L[ix];
V0: E[1]; V1: E[2]; W0: E[3]; r2: E[4];
t1: ["Kajiado","Nanyuki","Kericho","Kilifi","Meru","Embu","Bungoma","Kitale","Voi","Isiolo"][ix];
t2: ["Ruiru","Kakamega","Naivasha","Thika","Kisii","Nyeri","Ngong","Athi River","Machakos","Kisumu"][ix];
W2: W0*(1+r2/100)^2;
ra: 100*(V1-V0)/V0;
ratio: W2/W0;
/* diagnostics */
rn: 100*(V1-V0)/V1;
rq: 100*V1/V0;
tot: 100*(ratio-1);
hf: tot/2;
rw: 100*ratio;
]]></text>
  </questionvariables>
